APPLICATION FOR COMPENSATION UNDER SECTION 33(8) OF THE POCSO ACT

IN THE SPECIAL COURT UNDER THE POCSO ACT, KOTA

Special Case No. ______ of 2025

State of Rajasthan                                    … Applicant

Versus

Rajesh Kumar                                           … Respondent

APPLICATION FOR COMPENSATION UNDER SECTION 33(8) OF THE PROTECTION OF CHILDREN FROM SEXUAL OFFENCES ACT, 2012

MOST RESPECTFULLY SHOWETH:

1. That the victim in the present case is a minor girl aged 15 years.

2. That the victim has suffered sexual assault at the hands of the respondent.

3. That the victim has undergone severe trauma and requires counselling and rehabilitation.

4. That the victim's family has incurred expenses for medical treatment and counselling.

5. That the victim has lost educational opportunities due to the trauma.

6. That the victim requires financial support for her rehabilitation and future education.

PRAYER

It is therefore most respectfully prayed that this Hon'ble Court may be pleased to:

(a) Award adequate compensation to the victim under Section 33(8) of the POCSO Act;
(b) Direct the respondent to pay compensation for medical expenses, counselling, and rehabilitation;
(c) Pass any other order as this Hon'ble Court may deem fit and proper.

Place: Kota
